<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT ZIMBABWE IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT ZIMBABWE IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Zimbabwe by an</p>
<p>innings and 77 runs on the fourth day of the first test on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 349, Zimbabwe 145 and 127.</p>
</text>
